# Normalise line endings in the repository so a checkout is identical on every
# platform. This matters here beyond tidiness: the content hash that gives the
# grader its idempotency is taken over normalised source, and a repository that
# stores CRLF on one machine and LF on another makes reproducibility harder to
# reason about than it needs to be.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sh  text eol=lf

*.pptx binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf  binary
*.db   binary
